        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 40,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "He will feed his flock like a shepherd. He will gather the lambs in his arm, and carry them in his bosom. He will gently lead those who have their young.",
      "ko": "그는 목자 같이 양무리를 먹이시며 어린 양을 그 팔로 모아 품에 안으시며 젖먹이는 암컷들을 온순히 인도하시리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "6048f0b7ca1f3f2f882f0968419d0a17fe462e70a82331da4995f11595cb6207",
      "translation_text_hash": "54d06581aea3aa15c618c52e3c30a47ddf6c385fce7011d1baa80cc4abd727ef",
