      ],
      "en": "Who has measured the waters in the hollow of his hand, and marked off the sky with his span, and calculated the dust of the earth in a measuring basket, and weighed the mountains in scales, and the hills in a balance?",
      "ko": "누가 손바닥으로 바다 물을 헤아렸으며 뼘으로 하늘을 재었으며 땅의 티끌을 되에 담아 보았으며 명칭으로 산들을, 간칭으로 작은 산들을 달아 보았으랴",
      "source_text_hash": "dc126c05eceaeaef3b55e7ae62d4003f0ea3963b12ddc3a39be8341ab0623b9c",
      "translation_text_hash": "c9cc043086f7d9b5e776c820cef0f61b45c5e7d38b4c1d120335309679e8eae8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
